{"id": "188497", "name": "מציאת תמו שיחד עם וקטור מהווים מרחב גדול יותר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "gen_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ W = Span \\{ {{CT:0}} , {{CT:1}} \\} \\]</p><p>בנוסף נתון, וקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( v = {{CT:2}}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו תת מרחב חד מימדי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\( U \\oplus Span \\{ v \\} = W\\)</span>.</p><p>בסיס למרחב U:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "rank(addcol(vec,ans1))", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה לא נכונה. הסכום של U ושל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> איננו דו מימדי.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "rank(addcol(col(base_mat,1),col(base_mat,2),ans1))", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה לא נכונה. הסכום אינו מוכל ב-W.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["base_mat", "ord", "vec"], "nvariants": 50}